        "action_date": "2025-12-12",
        "action_desc": "Reported to House",
        "text": "<p><strong>AI for Main Street Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires&nbsp;Small Business Development Centers to assist small businesses in evaluating artificial intelligence, including by providing best practices for using artificial intelligence&nbsp;and guidance about using artificial intelligence to plan for unexpected circumstances.</p>",
